{"id":"m_4_14","name":"最盛大的宴席","des":"千钧一发之际，你修复了巨木的匠器核心，挫败了罗姆洛敏的阴谋。巨木周边愤怒的灵魂逐渐回归冷静，通道也再一次打通，灵魂之途得以重建。异变结束了。仍在等待着的，唯有整座森林对你们的感激与庆贺。","des2":"","type":1,"typeLabel":"主线","typeOrder":0,"subRaw":"第四章","subLabel":"第四章","subKey":"第四章","close":false,"reward":{"entries":[{"kind":"money","name":"银币","count":500,"rawMin":500,"rawMax":500,"min":500,"max":500,"countMin":500,"countMax":500,"typeId":"item_00001","icon":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"groupIndex":0,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1},{"kind":"ke","name":"氪金","count":20,"rawMin":20,"rawMax":20,"min":20,"max":20,"countMin":20,"countMax":20,"typeId":"item_00002","icon":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00002.webp","quality":5,"groupIndex":0,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1},{"kind":"exp","name":"营地经验值","count":100,"rawMin":100,"rawMax":100,"min":100,"max":100,"countMin":100,"countMax":100,"typeId":"item_00004","icon":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00004.webp","quality":5,"groupIndex":0,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1},{"kind":"item","name":"特别招待券","count":2,"rawMin":2,"rawMax":2,"min":2,"max":2,"countMin":2,"countMax":2,"typeId":"item_20023","icon":"/Common_ItemIcon/item_20023.webp","quality":5,"groupIndex":1,"groupRate":1,"groupCount":1,"actualProb":1,"cumulativeProb":1}],"text":[]},"startLocation":"三枝议会（黑森林 > 金弦之厅）","startNpc":{"name":"树冠守望者芭杜尔","id":"baduer_c4_area1_2"},"getTask":{"npc":null,"title":"","dialog":null,"condition":"推进《巨木之心，赫尔娜遗迹》自动接取"},"predecessorTasks":[{"id":"m_4_13","name":"巨木之心，赫尔娜遗迹","type":"add"}],"addTasks":[{"id":"m_5_1","name":"霜烬平原的召唤","close":false}],"unlockTasks":[{"id":"s_4_1","name":"携手共鸣，双生残响","close":false},{"id":"s_4_2","name":"笼罩宴席的心之影","close":false},{"id":"s_4_9","name":"危险的客人","close":false}],"unlockStages":[{"type":"room","label":"金弦宴堂","sub":"黑森林 > 金弦之厅","id":"c4_area1_7"}],"steps":[{"index":1,"name":"回到金弦之厅，与三枝议会的芭杜尔见面。","des":"唯一遗憾的是，巨木失去了心脏，森林的住民再也无法聆听到巨木的声音了。接下来的一切，都